# Presentation

This folder contains the presentation slides used to present the findings of the Volt Typhoon forensic investigation.

## Contents

* **Volt_Typhoon_Forensic_Investigation.pptx** – Final presentation deck summarizing the attack timeline, investigation process, key findings, MITRE ATT&CK mapping, and incident response observations.

## Presentation Topics

The presentation covers:

1. Initial Access
2. Persistence
3. Execution
4. Credential Access
5. Discovery
6. Lateral Movement
7. Collection
8. Command and Control (C2)
9. Defense Evasion
10. Cleanup
11. MITRE ATT&CK Mapping
12. Key Lessons Learned

## Purpose

The presentation was created as part of a cybersecurity threat hunting and incident response exercise to demonstrate investigation methodology, log analysis, and attack reconstruction using Splunk.

